---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../lib/site';
---
<BaseLayout title="联系"><section class="shell py-20 md:py-28"><p class="eyebrow">Contact</p><div class="mt-6 grid gap-12 md:grid-cols-[1fr_.7fr]"><h1 class="section-title">想法、问题，<br/>都值得聊聊。</h1><div class="border border-[var(--line)] bg-[var(--panel)] p-7"><p class="muted">Arcadia 仍在开发中。功能建议、缺陷和平台兼容问题请提交到公开仓库，方便跟踪处理进度。</p><div class="mt-7 flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a href={`${site.repository}/issues/new/choose`} rel="noreferrer" target="_blank" class="btn btn-primary">提交 Issue</a><a href={site.repository} rel="noreferrer" target="_blank" class="btn">查看源码</a></div><p class="muted mt-5 text-xs">请勿在公开 Issue 中提交 API Key、个人资料或其他敏感信息。</p></div></div></section></BaseLayout>
